    (1763::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'The ritual is the entrance, not a rope line: go through Casa Busano, use the phone by the coffee counter and wait for the bookcase door to open. Most reviews describe only a handful of guests, though Haeundae weekends can make the best balcony seats scarce. There is no evidence of a selective queer door.',
      'best_nights', 'Go after dinner for one properly made signature cocktail, a cigar or a slow balcony conversation above Gunam-ro. Friday and Saturday have more Haeundae movement; a quieter weeknight makes the hidden-door theatre and attentive bartending feel most convincing. This is a cocktail stop, not a dance destination.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Couples, cocktail enthusiasts, hotel guests and curious Haeundae visitors form a polished international-mainstream mix. Reviews do not establish an LGBTQ core, local queer programme or community ownership. It can work for a queer date, but should not be sold as one of Busan''s gay bars.',
      'dress_code', 'Smart-casual fits the dark, styled room, yet reviewers say the secret entrance is more theatrical than exclusionary. Resort clothes, a neat date look or an understated evening outfit all work. The practical rule is to arrive composed enough for a premium cocktail bar, not to imitate a prohibition costume.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Recent couples repeatedly describe respectful, personal service, careful drinks and warm extras near closing. That supports a broadly welcoming mixed bar, but there is no published queer policy or meaningful LGBTQ review sample. Judge it on hospitality, not an unverified community label.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_hidden_speakeasy_style_mainstream_cocktail_and_cigar_bar_above_casa_busano_in_haeundae_with_phone_and_bookcase_entry_balcony_signature_drinks_couple_visitor_crowd_and_no_verified_lgbtq_identity',
      'identity_note', 'The current TBR The Back Room is at 17-1 Gunam-ro above/inside Casa Busano, not inside Tap and Tapas. It is a mixed speakeasy-style cocktail bar; no reliable source verifies it as an LGBTQ venue.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297884-d12986888-Reviews-TBR_THE_BACK_ROOM-Busan.html','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/4945816','https://creatrip.com/en/spot/14323','https://www.trip.com/restaurant/south-korea/busan/detail/tbr-the-back-room-62012617/']::text[]),
