    (1769::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'Doors open late and the room matters most after midnight. Thursday is the lighter entry; Friday and Saturday drag bills and monthly themes can compress the small club quickly. There is little evidence of a formal velvet-rope queue, but arriving near 23:00 gives you space before the show and a better view.',
      'best_nights', 'Choose Friday or Saturday for committed lip-sync drag, bigger sound and the full local queer-club release. Thursday is better for meeting the bartenders and reading the room without the weekend crush. Monthly themes change the music and dress energy, so the current programme matters more than a fixed weekly promise.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Busan LGBTQ+ regulars, drag supporters, younger gay clubbers and international visitors share the floor. The reviews are notably multilingual and call the space foreigner-friendly, but locals give it its pulse. It is broader than a men-only bar, though not enough evidence supports a precise lesbian-to-gay split.',
      'dress_code', 'No formal code is published. Dance-ready black, streetwear, a playful queer look or full drag energy all make sense; the stage rewards expression more than polish. Wear shoes for a compact, loud floor and bring cash for drinks or performer support rather than treating applause as the whole tip.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'The clearest pattern is affection for the bartenders, performers and unusually warm queer-room feeling. Guests describe powerful sound, generous hosting and drag delivered with real commitment. Evidence is enthusiastic but still small, so keep the praise specific rather than pretending there is a vast review sample.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_late_week_drag_bar_and_lgbtq_nightclub_in_beomil_with_friday_saturday_drag_monthly_themes_compact_dancefloor_local_queer_core_foreigner_friendly_reports_and_strong_bartender_performer_praise',
      'identity_note', 'TightHall is an active drag bar and LGBTQ nightclub at 28 Jaseonggongwon-ro in Busan''s Beomil nightlife cluster. Current listings show Thursday through Saturday late opening, with drag concentrated on weekends.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.instagram.com/tighthall/','https://www.travelgay.com/venue/tighthall','https://wanderlog.com/place/details/6325068','https://qlist.app/venues/South-Korea/TightHall/YytSekRuQUhpUXRwWXIybzNoZjJRQQ','https://qlist.app/cities/South-Korea/Busan/23']::text[]),
