    (1766::bigint, jsonb_build_object(
      'queue_wait', 'At 20:00 or 21:00 you may have the bar and owner almost to yourself; reviews say it usually fills around 22:00–23:00. There is no club queue or status door. Walk in for a seat and conversation, then use the host''s tips if you want a busier dance floor elsewhere in Beomil.',
      'best_nights', 'Start here any evening for a serious classic cocktail and local orientation. Friday brings the strongest mix of football, regulars and visitors, while a weekday rewards solo travellers who actually want to talk. TOOL works best as the intelligent first drink, not the final all-out club.',
      'crowd_mix', 'Gay local regulars form the base, joined by Korean and international visitors who often arrive alone. English and some Japanese support make the room unusually easy for newcomers. The mood is male-leaning and intimate rather than a broad all-gender queer party, with locals and travellers mixing at the bar.',
      'dress_code', 'No dress code: jeans, clean casual layers and travel clothes are fine. The polish comes from the drinks, not the door. Sit close enough to watch the bartender work, and save your high-impact club look for wherever the night goes next.',
      'staff_inclusivity', 'Hospitality is the venue''s signature. Reviews repeatedly describe fluent English, attentive cocktail-making and an owner who writes down useful nightlife recommendations instead of letting visitors drift. That personal welcome is especially valuable in a small scene where language can otherwise feel like a wall.',
      'venue_classification', 'active_small_gay_owned_beomil_cocktail_bar_since_2014_with_quiet_early_hours_later_regular_build_classic_strong_drinks_football_interest_local_and_international_male_leaning_mix_and_exceptional_multilingual_host_consensus',
      'identity_note', 'TOOL is an active gay cocktail bar near Beomil Station, associated with address forms 14 Beomil-gil and 660-83 Beomil-dong. Current specialist listings show nightly opening from 20:00.',
      'source_urls', to_jsonb(array['https://www.travelgay.com/venue/tool','https://qlist.app/venues/Busan/TOOL/anNOK25JQmVzZ1lMQ1pzOTJhUC9EUQ','https://gayandasia.com/en/v/tool','https://www.tripadvisor.ca/Restaurant_Review-g297884-d32626809-Reviews-Tool-Busan.html','https://stg.travelgay.com/busan-gay-bars']::text[]),
